  message: "docs-prose:F2 (PR #4205): spec §14 gains a Role-flags-not-tier note — the example/test/fuzz/bench patterns set is_test_file/is_example_file role flags independent of supply_chain_tier; a co-located test resolves to tier 1, not tier 2 (the patterns sit under the tier-2 detection subsection only because role-flagging runs in the same pass). Keeps INV-tisid from re-opening on a spec misread. Code ground truth: supply_chain.py routes tests to tier 1 with is_test=True."  # db87
